# Emitter output. Derived from the build, and a stale copy in git would be a
# trust record nobody regenerated -- which is worse than none, because it looks
# current. Same rule as the contract package's own .gitignore.
#
# The release process attaches these as assets at a tag; it does not commit
# them to main.
/attest/
*.olean
*.ilean
*.trace
